---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../lib/products';
const canonical = `${SITE}/wedding-invitation-suites/palm-springs-wedding-invitations/`;
const faqs = [
{q:'Is this a printed invitation service?',a:'The featured Palm Springs save the date is a digital Canva template. You edit and download it, then arrange printing yourself. Confirm the details of any other design in its listing before purchasing.'},
{q:'Can I change the venue illustration?',a:'You can edit the template text, fonts and colors. A new illustration of your particular venue is a custom design request; it is not a standard text edit.'},
{q:'Do I need Canva Pro for the featured save the date?',a:'The Palm Springs save the date uses elements available on the free Canva plan, according to the current product details.'},
{q:'Can I request matching invitation and weekend pieces?',a:'Send a custom request describing your invitation, RSVP, details card and day-of needs. Ask the studio to confirm scope, availability, price and turnaround before making plans around a custom suite.'}
];
---
<Layout title="Palm Springs Wedding Invitations & Save the Dates | Hummingbird" description="Plan Palm Springs wedding stationery with a hand-drawn Canva save the date, desert design ideas, invitation wording and a practical destination wedding checklist.">
<link slot="head" rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
<script slot="head" is:inline type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'FAQPage',mainEntity:faqs.map(f=>({'@type':'Question',name:f.q,acceptedAnswer:{'@type':'Answer',text:f.a}}))})} />
<main><section class="hero"><div class="hero-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Desert celebrations · Thoughtful stationery</p><h1>Palm Springs wedding invitations &amp; save the dates.</h1><p class="lead">Bring the desert setting into your wedding stationery with hand-drawn architecture, warm color and room for the details guests need. Start with our editable Palm Springs save the date, or ask about a custom invitation suite.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/shop/palm-springs-save-the-date/">View the Palm Springs template</a><a class="button secondary" href="/custom-design-requests/">Ask about a custom suite</a></div><p>Digital template · Edit in Canva · Arrange your own printing</p></div><a class="hero-card" href="/shop/palm-springs-save-the-date/"><img src="https://i.etsystatic.com/64335254/r/il/21a397/8232662632/il_794xN.8232662632_m1ve.jpg" alt="Hand-drawn Palm Springs save the date template" width="794" height="794" fetchpriority="high" /></a></div></section>
<div class="container"><nav class="jump-links" aria-label="On this page"><a href="#style">Choose a style</a><a href="#suite">Build your suite</a><a href="#wording">Wording example</a><a href="#printing">Editing and printing</a><a href="#questions">FAQs</a></nav></div>
<section class="section" id="style"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">A setting, not just a color scheme</p><h2>Choose one Palm Springs detail to lead the design.</h2><div class="grid"><div class="card"><h3>Hand-drawn venue</h3><p>Let a hotel facade, courtyard or desert landscape be the focal point. Keep the names and date easy to find instead of crowding the illustration.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Mid-century modern</h3><p>Try geometric spacing, restrained typography and one accent color. Pair a distinctive heading with a readable font for addresses and weekend information.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Warm desert color</h3><p>Use sand, terracotta or muted pink with dark text. Print a proof: pale lettering and textured backgrounds can look different on paper than on screen.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="suite"><div class="container content"><h2>What belongs in a destination wedding suite?</h2><p>Give each piece a job so guests can find travel and RSVP details quickly.</p><ul class="list"><li><strong>Save the date:</strong> your names, wedding date, Palm Springs location and wedding website.</li><li><strong>Main invitation:</strong> who is hosting, ceremony date and time, venue name and full address, plus reception details if needed.</li><li><strong>RSVP:</strong> response deadline, response method, guest names and meal choices when relevant.</li><li><strong>Details card:</strong> website, accommodation information, dress code and transportation arrangements that are confirmed.</li><li><strong>Weekend itinerary:</strong> welcome drinks or farewell brunch with date, time, location and who is invited. Label optional events clearly.</li></ul><p>Set your response deadline around the dates your venue and vendors require final numbers. Send travel information as soon as it is confirmed so guests can plan.</p></div></section>
<section class="feature-band" id="wording"><div class="container content"><p class="eyebrow">Make it your own</p><h2>A simple invitation wording example.</h2><div class="hss-copy-box"><p>Together with their families<br />[Name] and [Name]<br />invite you to celebrate their wedding<br />[Day, month date, year] at [time]<br />[Venue name]<br />[Street address], Palm Springs, California<br />Reception to follow<br />Please reply by [date] at [wedding website]</p></div><p>Replace every placeholder, verify the venue address and spell out the dress code on your details card or website. Avoid putting a full weekend itinerary on the main invitation.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/wording-etiquette/">More invitation wording help</a></div></section>
<section class="section" id="printing"><div class="container content"><h2>From editable template to finished paper.</h2><ol class="list"><li>Review the product page for dimensions, included files and editing instructions. The featured save the date is a front-and-back 5 × 7 design.</li><li>Open the Canva link and replace names, date, location and wording. Text, fonts and colors can be edited; a new venue sketch needs a custom request.</li><li>Ask someone else to proofread names, times, address and website. Test links and QR codes if you add them.</li><li>Export using the printer’s file and bleed requirements. Order or print one proof before the full run.</li><li>Choose envelopes that fit the finished card and check postage for the assembled mailing.</li></ol><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/printing-guide/">Paper, sizing and printing help</a><a class="button secondary" href="/how-it-works/">How digital templates work</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="questions"><div class="container content"><h2>Questions before you choose a design.</h2><div class="hss-faq">{faqs.map(f=><details><summary>{f.q}</summary><p>{f.a}</p></details>)}</div><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="/shop/palm-springs-save-the-date/">Explore the Palm Springs save the date</a><a class="button secondary" href="/wedding-invitation-suites/joshua-tree-wedding-invitations/">Explore Joshua Tree stationery</a></div></div></section></main>
</Layout>
